This repository contains the independent Go implementation of the CDIN
Registry delivery-plane system. Its architecture and public data contracts
are defined by the CDIN Specification.

The JSON Schema documents under schemas/registry/v1 are mirrored from
cdin-editor/spec. The Spec repository remains the authority for those schemas;
this repository keeps a versioned copy for local and offline validation.

